      <p class="lead">The Cabins at Fort Wilderness are Disney Vacation Club cabins in the woods at the campground. Each is a one-bedroom cabin that sleeps six, with a queen bed, a queen-size pull-down and a bunk bed. You share the boat to Magic Kingdom, the internal buses, Trail's End Restaurant and Meadow Snack Bar with the campsites.</p>
